CM_ "Imported from tembikaipilot (martinl byd-sealion-7 lineage). Two unrelated groups in one file, mirroring tembikai's split DBC: RADAR_TRACK_00..09 (0x280-0x289) are 64-byte CAN-FD perception tracks from the Veoneer MVS4 on the PRIVATE bus (FD-capable silicon required); the classic 8-byte chassis sensor frames (ESC/IPB/brake/RPM/yaw/accel/gauge) live on the CHASSIS bus. None are on-car validated against our captures yet - treat scaling and bit positions as tembikai's claims until arbitrated.";
